{"id":"vod_md_3333","vodId":"3333","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"某科学的超电磁炮","name_cn":"某科学的超电磁炮","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230826-1/a13526394f24b41698a16af4de229a5b.jpg"},"summary":"本剧以镰池和马所著的轻小说《魔法禁书目录》中的人气角色御坂美琴为主角的外传漫画《科学超电磁炮》改编。故事发生在面积占据东京都西部的三分之一，居住着230万名人口，其中八成人口是学生的巨大都市“学园都市”。学园都市和外部隔离，研究最尖端科技。所有学生都接受超能力开发，并大都借由药物、催眠术与通电刺激等方式取得超能力。有各种类型不同能力，以范围和威力分为无能力者（Level 0）、低能力者（Level 1）、异能力者（Level 2）、强能力者（Level 3）、大能力者（Level 4）和超能力者（Level5）。故事从学园都市最强的电击公主“超电磁炮”御坂美琴，某天认识了和黑子一样担任风纪委员的初春饰利开始......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-26 07:47:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/HO0v4zMA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/Oe8Iptze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/aUHJnK6g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/U7dIZjyB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/abNUmBGm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/9ulSNvLL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/spvU68aF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/e3472LMT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/Bt3AACZ9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/PWoUkaA8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/kzKx8rk4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/LShdAb9q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/DOT0z9V6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/LCbl0hBM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/2023082